 contact-lens approaches"},{"text":"Orthokeratology"},{"text":"Multifocal/dual-focus approaches"},{"text":"Patient and parent counselling"}]}]},{"heading":"Clinical Internship","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The internship should provide exposure to:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Patient History","Visual Acuity","Refraction","Ocular Examination","Corneal Assessment","Contact-Lens Selection","Trial Fitting","Fit Evaluation","Patient Training","Follow-Up"]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal clinical exposure"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Optometry Clinic"},{"text":"Comprehensive examination"}],[{"text":"Refraction"},{"text":"Objective + subjective refraction"}],[{"text":"Contact Lens Clinic"},{"text":"Lens fitting"}],[{"text":"Cornea Clinic"},{"text":"Specialty-lens cases"}],[{"text":"Myopia Clinic"},{"text":"Myopia management"}],[{"text":"Dry Eye Clinic"},{"text":"Ocular-surface assessment"}],[{"text":"Pediatric Optometry"},{"text":"Myopia and compliance"}],[{"text":"Optical Practice"},{"text":"Lens dispensing and patient counselling"}]]}]},{"heading":"Contact-Lens Fitting Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional fitting process should follow a structured approach:"},{"type":"flow","items":["1. Patient History","2. Refractive Assessment","3. Ocular Health Examination","4. Corneal / Tear-Film Assessment","5. Lens Selection","6. Trial Lens Application","7. Centration + Movement Assessment","8. Vision Assessment","9. Comfort Assessment","10. Patient Training","11. Follow-Up"]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is not simply to obtain good visual acuity."},{"type":"p","text":"The specialist must balance:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Vision","Fit","Comfort","Ocular Health","Patient Compliance"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Projects to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Contact-Lens Fit Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a clinical case series documenting:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prescription"},{"text":"Corneal measurements"},{"text":"Lens parameters"},{"text":"Centration"},{"text":"Movement"},{"text":"Comfort"},{"text":"Visual acuity"},{"text":"Follow-up outcome"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Contact-Lens Complication Review"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dryness"},{"text":"Hypoxia-related changes"},{"text":"Corneal staining"},{"text":"Allergic reactions"},{"text":"Poor hygiene"},{"text":"Overwear"},{"text":"Poor lens fit"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Keratoconus & Specialty Lens Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RGP"},{"text":"Scleral"},{"text":"Hybrid"}]},{"type":"p","text":"in terms of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visual rehabilitation"},{"text":"Comfort"},{"text":"Fitting complexity"},{"text":"Clinical indications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Myopia Management Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a case-based project covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Myopia progression"},{"text":"Patient history"},{"text":"Baseline measurements"},{"text":"Management approach"},{"text":"Follow-up"},{"text":"Patient/parent counselling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Patient Compliance Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Study factors influencing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lens hygiene"},{"text":"Replacement compliance"},{"text":"Wearing schedule"},{"text":"Follow-up adherence"},{"text":"Complication rates"}]}]},{"heading":"Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Importance"],"rows":[[{"text":"Ocular Anatomy"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Optics"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Refraction"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Contact-Lens Fitting"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Corneal Assessment"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Ocular-Surface Assessment"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Patient Counselling"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Lens Materials"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Keratometry"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text